* - "competitor"
* - "style"
* - "ANYTHING_ELSE"
*/
value: string
; 
/** A brief explanation for the chosen classification. */
explanation: string
; 
/** The score of the chosen class. */
score: number
}
```

Eg:
```json
{
 "value": "own_reference",
 "explanation": "The content is about...",
 "score": 0.9
}
```

